1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,607
Without oil, an engine can destroy itself in minutes.

2
00:00:03,957 --> 00:00:09,248
It lubricates moving parts, carries away heat, traps dirt, and helps seal the pistons.

3
00:00:09,598 --> 00:00:14,340
An oil pump pushes oil from the sump up to the crankshaft, camshafts and turbo.

4
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:19,267
Over time, oil breaks down and fills with dirt, so it protects less and less.

5
00:00:19,617 --> 00:00:28,457
In 5W-30, the 5W is how well it flows when cold, the W is for winter. The 30 is its thickness when hot.

6
00:00:28,807 --> 00:00:36,920
Many modern cars go five to ten thousand miles, or a year, between changes. Your owner's manual has the real answer.

7
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:43,662
Engine off, car level, pull the dipstick, wipe it, dip again. The level should sit between min and max.

8
00:00:44,012 --> 00:00:46,564
Oil changes are cheap. Engines are not.
